# The first hunk of r6-alldrop-context-fallback, with patch2 quoting ZZZ11 where
# patch1 quotes pad11. Patch1 changes alpha at line 10 to beta, and patch2
# changes ZZZ12 to omega. The report must show each change on its own patch's
# side beside the other patch's version of the line. Since no line next to the
# differing ones is the same in both results, none of those differences can be
# placed, and the report must have no context section.
bin: DIFFOFDIFFS
args: p1.patch p2.patch
exit: 0
